{
  "arguments": {
    "query": "如何用 vLLM engine 参数启用 APC？只列参数，不执行命令。"
  },
  "observation": {
    "evidence": [
      {
        "id": "E80c4327332590fc69b6379c8",
        "chunk_id": "e8bd5b11227569842c9c0b5a",
        "parent_id": "34da95107d169899ca1fb5ae",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-automatic_prefix_caching.md",
        "sha256": "a939df40f6cde38cc48701cfee6626dbdc73c4f1e5df46921a7b88c496e31580",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-automatic_prefix_caching.md#L12-L12",
        "content": "Set `enable_prefix_caching=True` in vLLM engine to enable APC. Here is an example:",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "E6f352f27a9a752b7ddda2b69",
        "chunk_id": "5b467b156fda2408bc8abfcb",
        "parent_id": "945da38f9869ed99eb465a09",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md",
        "sha256": "f0316decf7985681413ca5ece1a238725da31e38c6ad228f5461a211e1833b60",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md#L33-L39",
        "content": "```python\n# Put the engine to sleep (level=1: offload weights to CPU RAM, discard KV cache)\nllm.sleep(level=1)\n\n# Wake up the engine (restore weights)\nllm.wake_up()\n```",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
