        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md#L7-L11",
        "content": "- **Fast resume**: Quickly wake up the engine and resume inference without full model reload.\n- **API endpoints**: Control sleep/wake_up state via HTTP endpoints or Python API.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
